    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence2-76",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "夜入人家，為有司所圍守，康祖突圍而去，並莫敢追。",
      "reading": "夜入人家被圍而逃。",
      "note": "夜入人家被圍而逃。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 76,
      "end_codepoint": 100,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence2-100",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "因夜還京口，半夕便至，明旦，守門詣府州要職。",
      "reading": "半夕還京口，翌晨詣官。",
      "note": "半夕還京口，翌晨詣官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 100,
      "end_codepoint": 122,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence2-122",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "俄而建康移書錄之，府州執事者並證康祖其夕在京口，遂見無恙。",
      "reading": "建康移書，京口執事以其在場作證。",
      "note": "建康移書，京口執事以其在場作證。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 122,
      "end_codepoint": 151,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence2-151",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "前後屢被糾劾，太祖以勳臣子，每原貸之。",
      "reading": "宋文帝念他為勳臣之子，屢原貸。",
      "note": "宋文帝念他為勳臣之子，屢原貸。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 151,
      "end_codepoint": 170,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence2-170",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "為員外郎十年，再坐摴蒱戲免。",
      "reading": "任員外郎十年，兩次因摴蒱戲免。",
      "note": "任員外郎十年，兩次因摴蒱戲免。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 170,
      "end_codepoint": 184,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence3-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "轉太子左積弩將軍，隨射聲校尉裴方明西征仇池，與方明同下廷尉，康祖免官。",
      "reading": "隨裴方明征仇池，以案一同下廷尉，康祖免官。",
      "note": "隨裴方明征仇池，以案一同下廷尉，康祖免官。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p003",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 35,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence3-35",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "頃之，世祖為豫州刺史，鎮歷陽，以康祖為征虜中兵參軍，既被委任，折節自修。",
      "reading": "後隨武陵王劉駿鎮歷陽，改習自修。",
      "note": "後隨武陵王劉駿鎮歷陽，改習自修。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p003",
