    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-38",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "軍次新蔡，與虜戰，俱前百餘里，濟融水。",
