      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-186",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "南平王鑠在壽陽，上慮為所圍，召康祖速反。",
      "reading": "劉鑠在壽陽，文帝召康祖速返。",
      "note": "劉鑠在壽陽，文帝召康祖速返。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 186,
      "end_codepoint": 206,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-206",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "康祖回軍，未至壽陽數十里，會虜永昌王庫仁真以長安之眾八萬騎，與康祖相及於尉武。",
      "reading": "永昌王庫仁真部與康祖遇於尉武。",
      "note": "永昌王庫仁真部與康祖遇於尉武。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 206,
      "end_codepoint": 245,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-245",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "康祖凡有八千人，軍副胡盛之欲附山依險，間行取至。",
      "reading": "記康祖部八千、胡盛之所議。",
      "note": "記康祖部八千、胡盛之所議。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 245,
      "end_codepoint": 269,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-269",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "康祖怒曰：「吾受命本朝，清蕩河洛。",
      "reading": "康祖自稱受命。",
      "note": "康祖自稱受命。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 269,
      "end_codepoint": 286,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-286",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "寇今自送，不復遠勞王師，犬羊雖多，實易摧滅。",
      "reading": "復稱魏軍雖多人可勝。",
      "note": "復稱魏軍雖多人可勝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 286,
      "end_codepoint": 308,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-308",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "吾兵精器練，去壽陽裁數十里，援軍尋至，亦何患乎。」",
      "reading": "自陳兵力及距壽陽不遠。",
      "note": "自陳兵力及距壽陽不遠。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 308,
      "end_codepoint": 333,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-333",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "乃結車營而進。",
      "reading": "車營進。",
      "note": "車營進。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 333,
      "end_codepoint": 340,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-340",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "虜四面來攻，大戰一日一夜，殺虜填積。",
      "reading": "相戰一日一夜。",
      "note": "相戰一日一夜。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 340,
      "end_codepoint": 358,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-358",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "虜分眾為三，且休且戰，以騎負草燒車營。",
      "reading": "魏軍分眾燒營。",
      "note": "魏軍分眾燒營。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 358,
      "end_codepoint": 377,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-377",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "康祖率厲將士，無不一當百，虜死者太半。",
      "reading": "傳稱魏軍死者太半。",
      "note": "傳稱魏軍死者太半。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 377,
      "end_codepoint": 396,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-396",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "會矢中頸死，於是大敗，舉營淪覆，為虜所殺盡，自免者裁數十人。",
      "reading": "宋50記矢中頸死，餘眾敗亡，僅數十人自免。",
      "note": "宋50記矢中頸死，餘眾敗亡，僅數十人自免。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 396,
      "end_codepoint": 426,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence4-426",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "虜傳康祖首示彭城，面如生。",
      "reading": "魏人將康祖首示彭城。",
      "note": "魏人將康祖首示彭城。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p004",
      "start_codepoint": 426,
      "end_codepoint": 439,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence5-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "二十八年，詔曰：「康祖班師尉武，戎律靡忒。",
      "reading": "元嘉二十八年詔追褒康祖班師尉武。",
      "note": "元嘉二十八年詔追褒康祖班師尉武。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 21,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence5-21",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "對眾以寡，殲殄太半。",
      "reading": "詔稱對眾以寡。",
      "note": "詔稱對眾以寡。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 21,
      "end_codepoint": 31,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence5-31",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "猛氣雲騰，志申力屈，沒世徇節，良可嘉悼。",
      "reading": "褒其徇節。",
      "note": "褒其徇節。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p005",
      "start_codepoint": 31,
      "end_codepoint": 51,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:received_sentence5-51",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "kd4_921_4cr",
      "source_quote": "宜加甄寵，以旌忠烈。",
      "reading": "詔請甄寵以旌忠烈。",
      "note": "詔請甄寵以旌忠烈。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-songshu-050-liukangzu:p005",
